## The DISK machine (C-BIOS_MSX1_EU_REPACK_DISK), AFTER: the same order, inside zerobas's own H.RUNC call
### C-BIOS_MSX1_EU_REPACK_DISK + none, disk msxdos103-cmd111.dsk, 20.0 s, keys ''
SYM init 2.6541 SP=F092 HIMEM=F380
HRUNC 2.6596 SP=F090 HIMEM=DE77
SYM hrunc_h 2.6599 SP=F086 HIMEM=DE77
SYM init_p2 2.6599 SP=F086 HIMEM=DE77
SYM boot_disk_go 2.6607 SP=F086 HIMEM=DE77
SYM dos_handoff 2.6878 SP=F084 HIMEM=DE77
HIT0100 4.088 SCRMOD=1 LINLEN=29 HIMEM=DE77
=== SCREEN 8 s HIMEM=DE77 H.RUNC-all-RET=1 H.RUNC-byte0=c9
  |  MSX-DOS version 1.03          
  |  Copyright 1984 by Microsoft   
HIT0100 8.939 SCRMOD=1 LINLEN=29 HIMEM=DE77
=== SCREEN 19 s HIMEM=DE77 H.RUNC-all-RET=1 H.RUNC-byte0=c9
  |  MSX-DOS version 1.03          
  |  Copyright 1984 by Microsoft   
  |  COMMAND version 1.11          
  |  Current date is Sun 84-01-01  
  |  Enter new date:               
hits0100 2


